---@alias Heading integer

---[<a href="https://github.com/beyond-all-reason/RecoilEngine/blob/master/rts/Lua/LuaSyncedCtrl.cpp#L4244-L4256" target="_blank">source</a>]
---
---Use this call to set up unit direction in a robust way. If unit was
---completely upright, new `{upx, upy, upz}` direction will be used as new "up"
---vector, the rotation set by "heading" will remain preserved.
---
---@param unitID UnitID
---@param heading Heading
---@param upx number
---@param upy number
---@param upz number
---@return nil
function Spring.SetUnitHeadingAndUpDir(unitID, heading, upx, upy, upz) end

